  "description": "Reid Viper 16 | 16 inch kids' bike\nLightweight, sturdy and built for adventure, the Reid Viper 16\" Kids' Bike is the perfect first big bike for children aged 3–6 years. Designed for everyday riding, it combines kid-specific geometry and components with durable construction for confident, comfortable cycling.\nThe single-speed drivetrain keeps things simple, making the Viper 16\" easy for young riders to pedal and control. Kid-specific components and geometry provide a comfortable fit, while reliable alloy components are built to handle the knocks and bumps of everyday adventures.\nA rear coaster brake provides simple, intuitive stopping by pedalling backwards, helping young riders develop confidence as they learn to ride and brake. Whether they're tearing around the neighbourhood, heading to the park or exploring with the family, the Viper 16\" is ready for whatever adventure comes next.\nBuilt to withstand the everyday bumps and scrapes that come with kids' cycling, the Viper 16\" gives young riders the freedom to explore while providing parents with a durable and dependable kids' bike.\nWho is the Viper 16 for?\nThe Viper 16\" Kids' Bike is ideal for:\n\n3–6 year olds ready for their first big bike\nYoung riders developing confidence on two wheels\nChildren learning to pedal, steer and brake independently\nParents looking for a lightweight, durable kids' bike\nEveryday adventures around the neighbourhood and local park\nYoung riders who need a bike built to handle everyday knocks and bumps\n\nFind the right fit\nChoosing the right bike size helps your child ride comfortably, confidently and safely. Use our Kids' Bike Size Guide by clicking the tab above to find the right Reid bike based on your child's height and age.",
